PRICING

*Our Tested Pricing*
These are the prices that got us *most sales at highest price* for each offer.

*CREDIT*
• DFY inquiries - $100 (clients) / $500 (non-clients)
• Course only - $300
• Standard repair (letters) - $1000
• Accelerated repair (5KO) - $2.5k
*FUNDING*
• *Course only*
    ◦ 1k entire course all trainings no support
    ◦ 6k for course + community + weekly group calls (Skool good for this)
• *STANDARD - 1on1 implementation (done with you / done for you) - 8k*
    ◦ standard funding experience with direct 1on1 support (potentially some DFY)
    ◦ you will coach them 1on1 (slack + client portal) + course access (notion)
    ◦ 4k admin / 4k success minimum 50k approved
    ◦ 2k admin / 6k success minimum 50k approved
    ◦ 1k admin / 7k success minimum 50k approved
        ▪︎ goal is to upfront cash collect as much as possible
        ▪︎ ladder close - start with most, if cant, propose to start for less down “as a favor”
• *AGED CORP - (done with you / done for you) - 15k*
    ◦ you will coach them 1on1 (slack + client portal) + course access (notion)
    ◦ *ALSO* includes an aged corp purchase (its like your premium package)
    ◦ 10k admin / 5k success minimum 150k approved
        ▪︎ goal is to upfront cash collect as much as possible
        ▪︎ you will have a cost for aged corp but great upfront cash collected
        ▪︎ ladder close on the way down “as a favor”
    ◦ 1k admin + 10k purchase / 5k success minimum 150k approved
        ▪︎ if client cannot afford aged corp, do normal funding with 1k down, get 50k approved with normal LLC, then purchase aged corp for 10k & continue
        ▪︎ you will have a cost for aged corp but great upfront cash collected
        ▪︎ ladder close on the way down “as a favor”
*Explore Different Pricing Options*
• *Pay in Full*: Offer a discount for clients who choose to pay the entire amount upfront.
    ◦ Typically ~20% discount from normal program price
    ◦ “the program costs $8k but if you pay in full it would be $6400”
• *Monthly Payment Plans*: Break down the total cost into manageable monthly payments.
• *Weekly Payment Plans*: Provide low-barrier entry with smaller, more frequent payments.
• *Financing Options*: Utilize third-party services like Affirm, Klarna, or Clarity Pay to provide clients with flexible financing solutions. (but be careful since some will report to personal credit.)
• *Performance Based:* Charging a fee based on results after they happen.

